  "rationale": "The four added columns converge on a single coherent, data-inferable focus: which expense records are worth flagging as risky/problematic and actionable. amount_tier, processing_delay_days, and is_pending_or_declined form differentiated facets (magnitude, timeliness, resolution state) at a useful granularity, and high_risk_indicator names the focus directly. The structure is sound but slightly weakened because high_risk_indicator is an opaque composite likely built from the other flags, edging toward restatement rather than adding an independent facet, and no descriptions clarify its derivation. The focus is genuinely actionable -- an analyst can drill into delayed, high-amount, or unresolved expenses -- so this is a real focus proposal, not a mechanical grab-bag."
}
